        Vision-Default, Prior-Override: Causal Mechanisms of Perception-Knowledge Conflict in Vision-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lietzow%2C+N">Niclas Lietzow</a>, 
      
