    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Stem: Rethinking Causal <span class="search-hit mathjax">Information</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Flow</span> in Sparse <span class="search-hit mathjax">Attention</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Niu%2C+L">Lin Niu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Luo%2C+X">Xin Luo</a>, 
      
